    "whyItMatters": "A service can be running while users still cannot complete useful requests, so availability must be tied to user-visible success rather than process uptime alone.",
    "example": "Define eligible events and acceptable outcomes, exclude only documented cases, calculate the indicator over a fixed window, and investigate both total failures and prolonged partial degradation.",
