    "whyItMatters": "Different tasks and failure conditions justify different models, and routing can improve outcome quality without sending every request to the largest option.",
    "example": "Send low-risk extraction to a fast model, complex code review to a stronger model, and fail over only to providers that satisfy the same data policy.",
