    "example": "Select block size from workload measurements, track allocation and eviction, isolate state between requests, and test cancellation and prefix sharing under memory pressure.",
    "confusion": "Paged KV cache manages runtime attention-state memory. It does not move model parameters to disk or extend the model's trained context limit.",
