    "letter": "R",
    "category": "Retrieval & generation",
    "says": "",
    "means": "A rank-fusion method that combines several result lists by summing contributions that decrease with each item's rank in each list.",
    "whyItMatters": "It can merge lexical, dense, or multi-query rankings without assuming their raw scores share the same scale.",
